371-all areas. `--changed` runs only areas whose paths changed against `<base>`
372-(default: merge base with `origin/main`) plus `hygiene`. Exit 0 pass, 1 check
373-failure, 2 usage error, 3 required tool missing (a typed gap, never a pass).
374-Each area prints `gate: <area>: PASS|FAIL|GAP <detail>`. The same invocation
375-runs in git hooks, in Actions (`gate.sh <area>` per job) and from harness
376-hooks.
