378-### CONTRACT-AFC-HOOK — Harness hook (D4-E)
379-
380-`hooks/ci-gate-hook.sh` reads the harness's pre-tool event on stdin, acts
381-only when the shell command is `git commit` or `git push` in a repository
382-that has `tools/ci/gate.sh`, and then runs `tools/ci/gate.sh --changed` when
383-the repository's git hooks are not installed or the command carries
384-`--no-verify`; a non-zero gate blocks the tool call with the gate output. It
